@startuml LectureProcessingState
' UML State Machine — Lecture lifecycle as tracked by lectures.status
' Owned by the WorkManager chain: TranscriptionWorker -> SummarizationWorker -> IndexingWorker

title Lecture Processing State Machine

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<terminal>>  #DCFCE7
  BackgroundColor<<error>>     #FEE2E2
  BackgroundColor<<cloud>>     #DBEAFE
  BackgroundColor<<local>>     #FEF3C7
}

[*] --> Recorded : audio captured\nor imported

state Recorded <<local>>
state Transcribing <<cloud>>
state Transcribed <<local>>
state Summarizing <<cloud>>
state Indexing <<local>>
state Ready <<terminal>>
state Failed <<error>>

Recorded     --> Transcribing  : enqueue\nTranscriptionWorker\n[network available]
Recorded     --> Recorded      : wait\n[offline]

Transcribing --> Transcribed   : STT result persisted
Transcribing --> Failed        : auth / quota /\nunrecoverable error

Transcribed  --> Summarizing   : enqueue\nSummarizationWorker
Summarizing  --> Indexing      : notes persisted
Summarizing  --> Failed        : Gemini error\nafter retries

Indexing     --> Ready         : FTS row written\n(+ embeddings* stretch)

Failed       --> Transcribing  : user taps Retry\n(from failed stage)
Failed       --> Summarizing   : user taps Retry\n(from failed stage)

Ready        --> [*]

note right of Ready
  Lecture appears in library
  with full transcript, notes,
  and is searchable via FTS.
end note

note bottom of Failed
  Partial results are kept.
  Retry resumes from the
  failed stage, not the start.
end note

legend right
  | Color | Meaning |
  | <#DBEAFE> | Cloud-bound work (network required) |
  | <#FEF3C7> | Local work |
  | <#DCFCE7> | Terminal success |
  | <#FEE2E2> | Error state |
endlegend

@enduml
